flowchart TD
  A[Inspect issues and project state] --> B[Prioritise improvement]
  B --> C[Create or update issue]
  C --> D[Create focused branch]
  D --> E[Implement code and data]
  E --> F[Validate JSON YAML HTML and links]
  F --> G{CI checks pass?}
  G -- No --> E
  G -- Yes --> H[Responsive and accessibility QA]
  H --> I{Within standing authority?}
  I -- No --> J[Ask owner for required decision]
  I -- Yes --> K[Merge to main]
  K --> L[Render auto-deploy]
  L --> M{Deployment live?}
  M -- No --> N[Investigate and repair]
  N --> E
  M -- Yes --> O[Smoke test and release report]
